{"about_the_game":"A Pacific island where a legendary female pilot has vanished.<br>Her daughter and a detective pursue clues to her disappearance amid threats from mutants roaming the forest.<br>Mysterious phone calls, forgotten medications... The closer they get to her, the more the island's mysteries slowly unfold.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cInteractive\u201d Puzzles</h2>Flying arrows can catch fire, and the fire spreads to the box with the fire arrow stuck in it. The fire explodes the bomb, which destroys the cheese stone.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1752228302\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Boss</h2>Survive battles against massive bosses with diverse patterns.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Boss.gif?t=1752228302\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cChain Action\u201d of Puzzles</h2>Player actions can create a chain reaction. If you light a barrel and throw it into a bush, the flames will spread and enemies will be hit by fire.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Fire.gif?t=1752228302\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interesting Dungeon Mechanics</h2>Encounter fascinating dungeon mechanics, much like riding a waterslide.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/WaterSlide.gif?t=1752228302\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons and Skills</h2>There are multiple weapons, and each weapon has multiple skills. Use your weapon according to the situation.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Attack.gif?t=1752228302\" /></div><h2 class=\"b